      "title": "Workflow Quick Guide",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Quick guide\n\nLoad a front image to generate a mesh with Hunyuan3D 2.1, then add textures. Open 3D World Interface to arrange the asset and export your scene.\n\nDownload `hunyuan_3d_v2.1.safetensors` from the model resource below and place it in `ComfyUI/models/checkpoints`.\n\nGit clone the 3D World Interface in the `ComfyUI/custom_nodes directory` from the link below.\n\nTexturing requires Linux and an NVIDIA CUDA GPU. Follow the repository README for setup. The first texture run downloads additional models.\n\nURLs are shown as plain text for your security, so you can inspect the full address before opening it.\n\n**Hunyuan nodes and setup**\n```text\nhttps://github.com/defnotkevin/ComfyUI-Hunyuan3d-v2-multiview\n```\n\n**Shape model files**\n```text\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/hunyuan3D_2.1_repackaged\n```\n\n**3D World Interface nodes and setup**\n```text\nhttps://github.com/defnotkevin/ComfyUI-3D-World-Interface\n```"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
